# =========================================================================
# BrandGuard AI — Supabase Cloud Database Configuration
# =========================================================================
# 1. Sign up for a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In your Supabase Dashboard, navigate to: Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy your "Project URL" and public "anon" key into the placeholders below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-api-key-here

# 4. In Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor, run the script in: supabase/schema.sql
#
# NOTE: BrandGuard AI automatically falls back to offline LocalStorage mode
# when these variables are not configured. No data is lost and existing workflows
# continue functioning immediately.

# =========================================================================
# BrandGuard AI — Server-Side AI Tone & Context Review Configuration
# =========================================================================
# CRITICAL SECURITY NOTE:
# NEVER prefix AI API keys with VITE_!
# These keys are strictly SERVER-SIDE credentials used by the Vercel Serverless
# Function (api/ai-tone-review.ts), Supabase Edge Function (supabase/functions/ai-tone-review),
# or Vite dev server proxy. They must NEVER be bundled into client code.

# OpenAI Configuration (Primary):
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Google Gemini Configuration (Alternative / Fallback):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# NOTE: If no AI provider credentials are provided, BrandGuard AI safely reports
# status: 'unavailable', preserves all deterministic rule checking, and allows
# drafts and workflows to proceed without error or fake results.

